        <headline>Fire Weather Watch issued August 2 at 1:34PM MDT until August 4 at 9:00PM MDT by NWS Grand Junction CO</headline>
        <description>* AFFECTED AREA...In Colorado, Fire Weather Zone 201 Routt
Forecast Area and Fire Weather Zone 292 North Fork Forecast
Area. In Utah, Fire Weather Zone 485 Eastern Ashley National
Forest and Fire Weather Zone 486 Eastern Uinta Basin.

* TIMING...From 11 AM MDT Monday through 9 PM MDT Monday.

* WINDS...Southwest 10 to 20 mph with gusts up to 35 mph.

* RELATIVE HUMIDITY...5 to 10 percent.

* IMPACTS...Any fire that develops will catch and spread
quickly. Outdoor burning is not recommended.
</description>
        <instruction>A Fire Weather Watch means that critical fire weather conditions
are forecast to occur. Listen for later forecasts and possible
Red Flag Warnings.</instruction>
