        <senderName>NWS Fort Worth TX</senderName>
        <headline>Severe Thunderstorm Warning issued August 2 at 3:22PM CDT until August 2 at 3:30PM CDT by NWS Fort Worth TX</headline>
        <description>At 321 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm was located over Little
River-Academy, or near Temple, moving southeast at 15 mph.

HAZARD...60 mph wind gusts and nickel size hail.

SOURCE...Trained weather spotters. At 259 PM CDT, a 60 mph wind gust
was reported 2 miles east of Morgan's Point Resort.

IMPACT...Expect damage to roofs, siding, and trees.

This severe thunderstorm will remain over mainly rural areas of
central Bell County.
</description>
        <instruction>For your protection stay inside a sturdy structure and keep away from
windows.</instruction>
